<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP appoints Tony Larkin as treasurer.</title>
<headline>BHP appoints Tony Larkin as treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Proprietary Co Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Tony Larkin as treasurer, effective September 8.  </p>
<p>Larkin replaces Tim Knott who was appointed group general manager finance and administration for BHP Petroleum on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Larkin was previously senior vice president finance and investor relations for Foster's Brewing Group and prior to that held a number of positions with BHP, most recently group general manager finance for BHP Minerals.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
